518
00:27:23,920 --> 00:27:24,800
Quoi ?

519
00:27:25,840 --> 00:27:27,080
Évadé de prison ?

520
00:27:28,320 --> 00:27:29,440
Hier soir,

521
00:27:30,040 --> 00:27:31,360
